  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# After Tooth Extraction\n\n\n\n###### Patient Information\n\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\n\n###### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nWisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nExposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nRemoval Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n\n##### Patient Information\n\n\n\n##### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\n\n###### Patient Information\n\n\n\n###### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\n\n## After Care Instructions\n\n\nFor your convenience, the link below is available for you to print post-operative instructions for your Extraction. This form is a PDF and requires you have Adobe Reader to open it.\n\n\n##### Post-operative Instructions\n\n\nDownload Instructions\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
